{"If ADMIN_FINE_GRAINED_AUTHZ (v1) and ADMIN_FINE_GRAINED_AUTHZ_V2 are enabled together, v1 endpoints/listeners still run but AdminPermissions.management() returns MgmtPermissionsV2, whose ClientPermissionsV2 throws UnsupportedOperationException for v1 management-permissions operations, causing 500s for /clients/{id}/management/permissions and removal-event cleanup": 0.8889835476875305, "ClientPermissionsV2#getClientsWithPermission returns resource names for resources of type 'Clients', but per-object resources are created without setting type. This can return 'Clients' (not a client UUID) and/or miss client resources, which breaks callers that treat results as client IDs": 0.6984204649925232, "PermissionClientTest relies on default client scopes list having at least two entries and stable ordering via get(1), which can cause IndexOutOfBoundsException or removing an unexpected scope if defaults change": 0.8103029727935791}